      "class": "dataset",
      "label": "Total health care expenditures by function of health care (HC) and by source of funding (HF). Year 2001-2024",
      "source": "Statistics Sweden",
      "updated": "2026-03-31T06:00:00Z",
      "link": {
        "related": [
